
<header class="app-header"><div class="container"><div class="header-content"><div class="logo">RwaSFX Admin</div><div class="title"><span class="vote-icon">🗳️</span>RwaSFX 2025 Election</div></div></div></header>
<div class="container my-5"><div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-md-8"><div class="success-card"><div class="success-icon">✅</div><h2 class="text-success mb-3">Notification Sent Successfully!</h2><div class="success-details"><p class="mb-2"><strong>Delivery Method:</strong> <span class="badge bg-primary"><%=method==='email'?'Email 📧':'SMS 📱'%></span></p><p class="mb-2"><strong>Recipients:</strong> <span class="badge bg-success"><%=count%> applicants</span></p><p class="text-muted mt-3"><%if(method==='sms'){%>The SMS messages have been queued for delivery via InTouch SMS Gateway.<%}else{%>The email notifications have been sent to the selected recipients.<%}%></p></div><div class="success-actions mt-4"><a href="/admin/feedback" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Send Another Notification</a><a href="/admin/applicants" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg ms-2">View Applicants</a></div></div></div></div></div>
